                "text": "I\u2019m proud to represent a district that leads the nation in forestry and forest products, providing jobs to over 11,000 Arkansans in our district alone. #ForestProductsWeek shines the light on an industry that sources everything from toilet paper to medical supplies for people all around the world. As the only licensed forester in Congress, I am committed to developing common sense solutions that boost forest management in order to promote healthy forests and forest product markets.",
