                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Honored to attend the groundbreaking ceremony for the new Weyerhaeuser facility in Monticello this afternoon. A healthy and innovative wood products industry is not only vital for jobs and economic benefits for our communities, but a tool necessary for the health and resiliency of our state\u2019s forests. I\u2019m thrilled to see more growth and opportunity make its way to Arkansas through the forest products industry and to see Weyerhaeuser, a company long established in Arkansas, continue to make such a substantial investment in the Natural State.",
