                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill transforms access to rural hospitals. With $50 billion appropriated toward modernizing and expanding access to these facilities, rural communities across Arkansas will receive greater access to health care. The One Big Beautiful Bill creates greater opportunities for rural communities to receive needed health care.",
