                "text": "Arkansas forestry remains a bedrock of our state\u2019s economy \u2014 creating jobs and security for countless Arkansans. As we wrap up National Forest Products Week, we reflect on an industry that impacts nearly every corner of our lives \u2014 from toilet paper to medical supplies. Congress must continue developing common sense legislation, like the Fix Our Forests Act, to boost forest management in order to promote healthy forests and forest product markets nationwide.",
