                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "3/3: When Arkansas builds:\n\n\u2714\ufe0fMore jobs are created for Arkansans in construction, energy, and manufacturing.\n\n\u2714\ufe0fHardworking Arkansans receive bigger paychecks as new projects drive demand for skilled workers.\n\n\u2714\ufe0fRural communities get better access to health care and better roads because infrastructure upgrades aren\u2019t delayed.\n\n\u2714\ufe0fGas prices are lowered because infrastructure is built to produce more gas.\n\n\u2714\ufe0fElectricity costs are lowered as new power generation and transmission can come online faster.\n\n\u2714\ufe0fGrocery bills are lowered because infrastructure is built on time leading to more processing facilities.",
